OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BAll-Ireland winners Mayo host Donegal  
OL,5,Bin league opener                       
OL,6,GDivision One champions Donegal will    
OL,7,Gface All-Ireland winners Mayo in the   
OL,8,Gfirst round of the Allianz Football    
OL,9,GLeague.                                
OL,11,FJim McGuinness' side will travel to    
OL,12,FMacHale Park for the opening Division  
OL,13,FOne fixture on Saturday, 23 January    
OL,14,F17:00 GMT, with Cork v Meath throwing  
OL,15,Fin at the same time.                   
OL,17,FAlso on a stacked Saturday of action,  
OL,18,FUlster champions Armagh will host      
OL,19,FConnacht winners Roscommon at 18:00    
OL,20,Fwhile Galway take on All-Ireland       
OL,21,Fbeaten finalists Kerry at 19:00.       
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
